  /Subject (La Loire \340 V\351lo \(EuroVelo 6\) is France's most popular cycle route. From Nantes, it follows the river upstream to Angers and Saumur on a flat, very well signposted route that is largely traffic-free: the ideal trip for your first cycling holiday, with family or friends.) /Title (La Loire \340 V\351lo \205 Route sheet | Bike'N Tour) /Trapped /False
